Subject: [PATCH] base: Add support for hide applist [1/2]

Hide the apps listed in Settings.Secure.HIDE_APPLIST from other user
apps. Ported from HertzifyOS, hooked into shouldFilterApplication since
AOSPA has no shouldFilterApplicationCustom.

Change-Id: If19d4724cfd7e9213b0ef3c98eaa10852fb1cf43
---
