 .../util/hertzify/HideAppListUtils.java       | 115 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../validators/SecureSettingsValidators.java  |   1 +
 .../com/android/server/pm/ComputerEngine.java |   7 ++
 4 files changed, 130 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 core/java/com/android/internal/util/hertzify/HideAppListUtils.java

